+## 3. `CMakeLists.txt`：静态链接 readline/tinfo（未归档，需重放）
+
+### 原因
+
+`DPV_ABC=ON` 时 dpvcore 需要链接 readline。原逻辑 `find_library(READLINE_LIB readline REQUIRED)`
+找到的是动态库，在 `-static` 链接下会留下对 `libreadline.so`/`libtinfo.so` 的运行时依赖，
+破坏完全静态结果。readline 依赖 termcap（tinfo），静态链接时 `libtinfo.a` 必须放在 readline
+之后。
+
+### 完整 diff（可用 `git apply` 重放）
+
+```diff
+diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
+index 39eecff..a0fff33 100644
+--- a/CMakeLists.txt
++++ b/CMakeLists.txt
+@@ -163,12 +163,22 @@ if(DPV_ABC)
+   endif()
+ endif()
+ if(DPV_ABC AND ABC_LIB)
+-  find_library(READLINE_LIB readline REQUIRED)
+-  message(STATUS "DPV_ABC=ON  ABC=${ABC_LIB}")
++  if(DPV_STATIC)
++    # Fully static: prefer the readline/tinfo archives so the final binary has
++    # no runtime dependency on libreadline.so/libtinfo.so. readline needs
++    # termcap (tinfo), which must come after it on the link line.
++    find_library(READLINE_LIB NAMES libreadline.a readline REQUIRED)
++    find_library(TINFO_LIB NAMES libtinfo.a tinfo REQUIRED)
++  else()
++    find_library(READLINE_LIB readline REQUIRED)
++    set(TINFO_LIB "")
++  endif()
++  message(STATUS "DPV_ABC=ON  ABC=${ABC_LIB}  READLINE=${READLINE_LIB}  TINFO=${TINFO_LIB}")
+   list(APPEND AIGSOLVE_DEFINITIONS
+     DPV_HAVE_ABC LIN64 "DPV_ABC_RC_PATH=\"${ABC_DIR}/abc.rc\"")
+   list(APPEND AIGSOLVE_INCLUDE_DIRS "${ABC_DIR}/src")
+-  target_link_libraries(dpvcore PUBLIC ${ABC_LIB} ${READLINE_LIB} ${CMAKE_DL_LIBS})
++  target_link_libraries(dpvcore PUBLIC
++    ${ABC_LIB} ${READLINE_LIB} ${TINFO_LIB} ${CMAKE_DL_LIBS})
+   if(CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME STREQUAL "Linux")
+     target_link_libraries(dpvcore PUBLIC rt)
+   endif()
+```
